This program links and uses:
- edo9300/ygopro-core (https://github.com/edo9300/ygopro-core), AGPL-3.0-or-later; based on
  Fluorohydride's YGOPro core (https://github.com/Fluorohydride/ygopro-core, MIT). Fetched at the
  commit pinned in CMakeLists.txt.
- Lua (bundled with ygopro-core), MIT. Copyright (C) 1994-2025 Lua.org, PUC-Rio.
- nlohmann/json 3.11.3 (https://github.com/nlohmann/json), MIT. Copyright (c) 2013-2022 Niels
  Lohmann.
- SQLite (https://www.sqlite.org), public domain, when built with .cdb support (the system's).

At run time it loads the card scripts of Project Ignis (https://github.com/ProjectIgnis/CardScripts,
AGPL-3.0), unmodified, and reads card databases of Project Ignis' BabelCDB
(https://github.com/ProjectIgnis/BabelCDB). data/setcodes.json is derived from BabelCDB and from
EDOPro's system strings (https://github.com/ProjectIgnis/Distribution).

